<ui-header title="发布帖子"/><view class="page publish-page"><view class="publish-prompt">记录今天的猫咪日常……</view><textarea class="post-editor" value="{{body}}" bindinput="bodyInput" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" placeholder="分享你和猫咪的故事"/><view class="word-count {{length > 2000 ? 'over-limit' : ''}}">{{length}} / 2000</view>
<view class="draft-photos"><view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="path" class="draft-photo"><image src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill" data-path="{{item.path}}" bindtap="preview"/><button class="remove-image" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeImage" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" aria-label="移除图片"><image src="/assets/ui/close-white.png"/></button></view></view>
<button class="add-image" bindtap="chooseImages" disabled="{{busy || pending || images.length >= 9}}"><image class="ui-icon" src="/assets/ui/plus-green.png"/><text>添加图片{{images.length ? '（' + images.length + '/9）' : ''}}</text></button>
<view class="tag-instruction">话题与猫咪均可不选，一帖可选多只猫。</view><view class="selected-tags"><text class="tag" wx:for="{{chosenTags}}" wx:key="id"># {{item.name}}</text></view><button class="select-tags" bindtap="selectTags" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">选择 / 修改 Tag<image class="ui-icon" src="/assets/ui/right-green.png"/></button>
<view class="notice">发帖不需要填写遇见区域。</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{pending}}">提交结果正在确认，输入已保留，请重试原提交。</view><view class="notice" aria-live="polite">{{message}}</view><view class="publish-spacer"></view><button class="primary publish-button" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{pending ? '确认结果 / 重试原提交' : '发布'}}</button></view>
